    {
      "id": "UgwZ_1Oi6saURkQmzHB4AaABAg",
      "author": "@jamesanthonymarsters3498",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_luPPdWF6RQi5xHD6PvvTNbjpECPEh3E6oLXD0xAoIHVl8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Travel Lifestyle,\r\n\r\nIt was nice that you took the time to put this video together. While watching it, I even saw footage of my wife, myself and other members of our family on Palmerston Island. I am a 5th-generation member of the Marsters Family from Palmerston Island.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, some of the footage shown is not from Palmerston Island—it appears to be from another island and even another country. Some of the information you have provided is also incorrect.\r\n\r\nWe are disappointed that other people’s photographs and video footage appear to have been used without their permission and presented with your own version of the story.\r\n\r\nOn behalf of the Marsters family of Palmerston Island,    we respectfully ask that you review the entire video, correct the inaccurate information, properly identify all locations, acknowledge the original owners of the content and remove any material you do not have permission to use.\r\n\r\nPlease do the right thing and set the record straight.",
      "likeCount": 0,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T04:54:01Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "UgwFi2eXSS-hHXryOOp4AaABAg",
      "author": "@travelintolifeus",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/CtizGHrwfYKaRxW5BABv58hFpGE9tQnFNT-I8TH_fGoI8B4onEPVK_KKSSE0C1hwyF3RGMrGwWs=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Would you choose a life like Palmerston’s—isolated from the world, but surrounded by family?",
      "likeCount": 0,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T01:54:29Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "UgyLPmrDb2sehuuCEYJ4AaABAg",
      "author": "@GlobeLifeHidden",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ZMzDJNlstEgNjdniglDSfon-IP08VCu6ylNi1i3TBFE0Qj0ahnjZdhGa65kqSvio2y6zHB4r=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Only around 28 people live here - almost everyone is connected to one family. Could you survive on an island with airport no store and no roads?",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T01:37:55Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Ugxr02RJVAwmnk6rVph4AaABAg",
      "author": "@Globallifejourneyus",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/IAcc6cyuOIrVppKIDzKsIRnCW8Z6yzUHn7ujGAi-ygTTtPvxlfjXgPbeEdx3RQ-T55FzB60FWw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Palmerston makes “community” feel very literal. There’s no disappearing into a crowd here, and no real anonymity either. Watching how these families share work, traditions, and life on such a remote island was strangely intimate.",
      "likeCount": 0,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T01:31:33Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "UgwQUEB3K31vFFm9_wx4AaABAg",
      "author": "@EarthinMotion25",
